@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
actor "Schema Author" as Author
actor "Application Developer" as Dev
actor "Binary Analyst / User" as Analyst
actor "Operations Engineer" as Ops
rectangle "BinMorph System" as System {
  component "Declarative Binary Schema\nExecutable / Daemon" as BinMorph
}
cloud "Build Toolchain" as Toolchain
folder "JSON Schema Files" as Schemas
file "Binary Inputs" as Inputs
artifact "Generated Libraries" as Libraries
system "Client Applications" as Apps

Author --> Schemas : defines byte layouts
Author --> BinMorph : validates/registers schemas
Dev --> BinMorph : requests code generation
BinMorph --> Toolchain : compiles/packages generated code
BinMorph --> Libraries : publishes versioned artifacts
Dev --> Libraries : links/imports typed API
Apps --> Libraries : reads/writes schema objects
Analyst --> BinMorph : interprets arbitrary binary input
Inputs --> BinMorph : files, streams, memory blobs
Ops --> BinMorph : deploys, monitors, configures
BinMorph --> Schemas : loads/imports
@enduml
